{"id":"9ae082208bc5fc2b","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-curve-genus.md","title":"Genus of Curve","display":"df-curve-genus — Genus of Curve","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-curve-genus","aliases":["58-df-curve-genus","Genus of Curve"],"display":"df-curve-genus — Genus of Curve","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-compact-riemann-surface.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-sheaf-cohomology.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-dimension.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-curve-genus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-curve-genus</span><span>Genus of Curve</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-curve-genus — Genus of Curve"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5591939bd3612ac0\" href=\"?note=5591939bd3612ac0\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-compact-riemann-surface.md\">../batch04/58-df-compact-riemann-surface.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3de4d546216326d8\" href=\"?note=3de4d546216326d8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-sheaf-cohomology.md\">../batch14/58-df-sheaf-cohomology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"522587a7fec6816a\" href=\"?note=522587a7fec6816a\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-dimension.md\">../batch09/58-df-dimension.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,K_C,g\\in V\">\\(C,K_C,g\\in V\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_C\">\\(K_C\\)</span> is supplied sheaf data on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurface}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurface}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SheafCohomology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SheafCohomology}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\)</span> are the predicates from the cited dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C}\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb C,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C}\\in V\\)</span> are the canonical complex-field data.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CurveGenus}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CurveGenus}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_C,\\mathsf{ShAb}_C,\\mathsf{Ab},\\Gamma_C\\in V\">\\(\\tau_C,\\mathsf{ShAb}_C,\\mathsf{Ab},\\Gamma_C\\in V\\)</span> 是固定环境数据；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurfaceStructure}_S(C,\\tau_C,\\mathcal A)\">\\(\\exists\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurfaceStructure}_S(C,\\tau_C,\\mathcal A)\\)</span>。这里的拓扑与上同调调用中的拓扑相同，值范畴、层范畴和全局截面函数不被任意存在选择。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}curve\\text{-}genus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CurveGenus}_S(g,C,K_C)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurface}_S(C)\\land g\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists H,+_H,\\odot_H,0_H,\\mathcal V_H\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SheafCohomology}_S(H,0,C,\\tau_C,K_C,\\mathsf{ShAb}_C,\\mathsf{Ab},\\Gamma_C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\mathcal V_H=\n\\langle H,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C},0_H\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\mathrm{Dimension}_S(g,\\mathcal V_H)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}curve\\text{-}genus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CurveGenus}_S(g,C,K_C)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurface}_S(C)\\land g\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists H,+_H,\\odot_H,0_H,\\mathcal V_H\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SheafCohomology}_S(H,0,C,\\tau_C,K_C,\\mathsf{ShAb}_C,\\mathsf{Ab},\\Gamma_C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\mathcal V_H=\n\\langle H,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C},0_H\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\mathrm{Dimension}_S(g,\\mathcal V_H)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This predicate is deliberately relative to the supplied sheaf <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_C\">\\(K_C\\)</span>. When <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_C\">\\(K_C\\)</span> has separately been certified as the holomorphic cotangent sheaf, it gives the usual genus <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim_{\\mathbb C}H^0(C,K_C)\">\\(\\dim_{\\mathbb C}H^0(C,K_C)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The earlier formula used global sections and dimension as unbound meta-level notation; both are now mediated by existing predicates.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Miranda, Algebraic Curves and Riemann Surfaces</li>\n<li>Farkas and Kra, Riemann Surfaces</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-compact-riemann-surface.md","status":"resolved","id":"5591939bd3612ac0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-compact-riemann-surface.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-sheaf-cohomology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3de4d546216326d8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-sheaf-cohomology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-dimension.md","status":"resolved","id":"522587a7fec6816a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-dimension.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C,K_C,g\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"K_C","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurface}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SheafCohomology}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dimension}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb C,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CurveGenus}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_C,\\mathsf{ShAb}_C,\\mathsf{Ab},\\Gamma_C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurfaceStructure}_S(C,\\tau_C,\\mathcal A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}curve\\text{-}genus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CurveGenus}_S(g,C,K_C)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurface}_S(C)\\land g\\in\\omega\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists H,+_H,\\odot_H,0_H,\\mathcal V_H\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SheafCohomology}_S(H,0,C,\\tau_C,K_C,\\mathsf{ShAb}_C,\\mathsf{Ab},\\Gamma_C)\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\\mathcal V_H=\n\\langle H,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0_{\\mathbb C},1_{\\mathbb C},0_H\\rangle\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\\mathrm{Dimension}_S(g,\\mathcal V_H)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"K_C","display":false},{"tex":"K_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\dim_{\\mathbb C}H^0(C,K_C)","display":false}],"bytes":2029,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-390","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-curve-genus.md|58-df-curve-genus]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["5591939bd3612ac0","3de4d546216326d8","522587a7fec6816a"]}